Dialogue: 1,0:00:03.02,0:00:10.32,Kimi_no_Todoke_OP1-TL,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(150,150)}Under the gentle sunlight, the chimes seem to pause.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:10.78,0:00:18.12,Kimi_no_Todoke_OP1-TL,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(150,150)}I breathe deeper as the wind brushes my cheeks.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:18.45,0:00:23.29,Kimi_no_Todoke_OP1-TL,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(150,150)}Those indirect tears, the tomorrow we named,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:23.29,0:00:27.46,Kimi_no_Todoke_OP1-TL,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(150,150)}And the criss-crossing lines stained future…
Dialogue: 1,0:00:28.38,0:00:32.17,Kimi_no_Todoke_OP1-TL,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(150,150)}Let these innocent feelings
Dialogue: 1,0:00:32.17,0:00:36.47,Kimi_no_Todoke_OP1-TL,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(150,150)}And our days of laughter
Dialogue: 1,0:00:36.47,0:00:43.56,Kimi_no_Todoke_OP1-TL,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(150,150)}Become all the more precious to us.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.56,0:00:47.44,Kimi_no_Todoke_OP1-TL,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(150,150)}You showed me many new things,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:47.44,0:00:51.61,Kimi_no_Todoke_OP1-TL,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(150,150)}Crossing the fragmented moments.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.61,0:00:57.45,Kimi_no_Todoke_OP1-TL,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(150,150)}I want my feelings to join yours… to reach you…
