Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.49,0:02:23.95,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I hope you'll be adopted by someone nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.63,0:02:32.21,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,My nickname is Sadako.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.00,0:02:35.46,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Like from "The Ring".
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.96,0:02:40.22,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,My motto is: "Do a good deed every day."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.76,0:02:46.39,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Did you hear about Sadako from class D?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.39,0:02:48.48,Default,Girl2,0000,0000,0000,,The one who can see ghosts?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.48,0:02:49.44,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, that one!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.44,0:02:53.27,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Apparently, she was rejected right before summer break!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.27,0:02:54.61,Default,Girl2,0000,0000,0000,,Seriously?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.61,0:02:55.73,Default,Girl2,0000,0000,0000,,Who did she ask out?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.28,0:02:58.49,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Ka-ze-ha-ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.49,0:03:00.45,Default,All,0000,0000,0000,,Kazehaya?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.45,0:03:03.32,Default,Girl2,0000,0000,0000,,Well yeah, Kazehaya and Sadako wouldn't make a good couple...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.79,0:03:08.00,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Morning...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.09,0:03:17.67,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, it's probably because I talked to them out of the blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.30,0:03:20.47,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry I scared you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.47,0:03:21.76,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,She's praying.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.76,0:03:23.64,Default,Guy2,0000,0000,0000,,Is there a ghost around or something?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.26,0:03:27.72,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if that puppy is doing okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.89,0:03:30.77,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Why is she staring off into space...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.77,0:03:33.02,Default,Guy2,0000,0000,0000,,And why is she soaked?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.36,0:03:41.24,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I find it hard to interact with people, and I can't quite get the hang of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.11,0:03:45.91,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,but I hope I'll be able to break down these walls one at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.04,0:03:48.95,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.71,0:03:52.96,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,You're drenched, Kazehaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.75,0:03:55.04,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,I couldn't avoid the rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.04,0:03:56.13,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.13,0:03:57.84,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Look at all those people gathering around him instantly!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.84,0:03:59.84,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,As expected from Kazehaya-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.42,0:04:02.59,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,He's lively, even when he's drenched from the rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.59,0:04:03.84,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,You're going to catch a cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.44,0:04:13.31,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.48,0:04:17.27,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,G-Good morning...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.15,0:04:23.53,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Even after all the trouble I caused him,\N he's willing to treat me like everyone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.53,0:04:25.57,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,He's a great guy after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.95,0:04:27.74,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,The rain got you, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.74,0:04:29.29,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,You're soaked!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.29,0:04:30.08,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Do you have a change of clothes?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.08,0:04:33.54,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, Kazehaya's being extra nice to her...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.17,0:04:35.17,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Change of clothes?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.75,0:04:40.55,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Oh yeah... I should bring sweats next time to avoid this situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.55,0:04:42.13,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, you don't?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.01,0:04:46.59,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,And so, that ramen was like...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.59,0:04:47.26,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Yoshida!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.80,0:04:49.60,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Don't you have an extra pair of sweats?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.10,0:04:51.68,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.18,0:04:54.98,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,What the heck happened to you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.98,0:04:57.19,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Sadako, don't you have any spare clothes?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.90,0:05:01.57,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Geez, you're hopeless...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.82,0:05:04.90,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,There, found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.90,0:05:06.57,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Tadaa!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.24,0:05:09.87,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Smells like mold.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.41,0:05:09.24,Default-alt,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.33,0:05:12.29,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Oh yeah, could you wash it when you're done with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.87,0:05:16.87,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,T-Th-Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.50,0:05:20.59,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,A handkerchief's not going to cut it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.96,0:05:25.93,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, it's a little wet since I used it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.01,0:05:29.93,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Th-Thank you...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.10,0:05:33.89,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I find it hard to interact with people, but today...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.43,0:05:40.56,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,...for the first time, I realize there\N are so many great people out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.36,0:05:46.78,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so happy people from my class are willing to lend things to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.57,0:05:51.08,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I want to make it up to them...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.62,0:05:53.29,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,W-Was that a Jizo?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.62,0:05:53.29,Note,,0000,0000,0000,,Note: A Jizo is a statue of Ksitigarbha, a Buddhist monk.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.29,0:06:01.04,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Come to think of it, it was thanks to Kazehaya-kun\N that I was able to start talking to Yano-san and Yoshida-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.71,0:06:08.30,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I really look up to and respect Kazehaya-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.93,0:06:12.14,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry too much about her, Kazehaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.81,0:06:14.60,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Talking about Sadako, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.60,0:06:17.27,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,I know you feel bad about rejecting her, but..
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.02,0:06:18.94,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't reject her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.94,0:06:19.56,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.56,0:06:21.81,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Don't tell me you accepted...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.77,0:06:24.82,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,It's not what you're thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.07,0:06:29.11,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Is it all right if I expect...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.66,0:06:32.03,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,...that we'll see each other over the summer, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.87,0:06:37.87,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Over the summer?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.87,0:06:40.54,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be able to see you at summer classes, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.59,0:06:43.25,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,No-
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.25,0:06:46.84,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,You won't avoid me even if we see each other there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.67,0:06:49.30,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,K-Kuronuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.22,0:06:55.81,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I've always wanted to be like you,\N and I've always looked up to you, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.81,0:07:00.06,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Those feelings of respect have grown greater and greater!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.81,0:07:05.02,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I'm... I'm sure these feelings for you will never change!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.19,0:07:12.07,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,So she meant "attracted" as in respect?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.07,0:07:14.07,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Darn it... I was so full of myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.87,0:07:18.04,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you so much, Kazehaya-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.66,0:07:22.08,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Kazehaya...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.04,0:07:24.92,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,It's not about rejecting or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.50,0:07:27.71,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,That's not what it was about...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.71,0:07:30.38,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,What are you talking about? I don't get it at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.93,0:07:33.93,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,I'm the one who didn't get it...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.93,0:07:36.51,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,No, I don't get it at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.89,0:07:43.60,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I was only thinking of how he may be annoyed at me,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.69,0:07:50.74,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,but instead of rejecting me, Kazehaya-kun treated me kindly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.79,0:07:58.95,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,What's this for?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.95,0:08:00.37,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,I got one, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.54,0:08:05.50,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Sadako left those on your desks earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.50,0:08:07.25,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Why did I get one, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.25,0:08:09.13,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,It's her way of saying thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.51,0:08:12.26,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,You give in too easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.14,0:08:18.97,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I also found out that you can cry when you're happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.98,0:08:26.94,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Kuronuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.56,0:08:29.86,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Is this from you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.78,0:08:37.57,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Th-Thank you for the towel...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.57,0:08:39.70,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, you should have told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.04,0:08:41.50,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Otherwise, I wouldn't have known who it was from.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.50,0:08:43.25,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I-I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.33,0:08:48.17,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Thank God it was from you...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.04,0:08:51.09,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know what I would have said to you if I'd been wrong...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.84,0:08:54.63,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,You know, sometimes I act without thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.01,0:08:58.05,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,I was starting to think the whole towel thing was crossing the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.39,0:09:02.35,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Truth is, I'm a little nervous right now, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.18,0:09:05.23,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Just a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.02,0:09:09.98,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Kazehaya rejected Sadako, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.98,0:09:11.48,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,You got milk?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.27,0:09:11.23,Default-alt,Girl2,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.03,0:09:14.86,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I was thinking of giving this to the dog...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.86,0:09:16.53,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Do you like dogs?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.99,0:09:18.32,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,I saw one this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.32,0:09:19.83,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,A stray, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.53,0:09:21.83,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Stray?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.83,0:09:23.75,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,I got my clothes wet while playing with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.75,0:09:26.67,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Th-The one by the river?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.55,0:09:38.01,Kimi-Signs,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur1\fnBrianne's hand\fs55\c&H070A0B&\frx345\fry20\frz20\fax-0.3\fay0.03\pos(1151,887)}Please adopt me
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.01,0:09:45.77,Kimi-Signs,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur1.5\fnBrianne's hand\fs10\c&H142028&\fay-0.03\pos(939,755)}Please adopt me
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.84,0:09:34.97,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.64,0:09:41.97,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, so this was {\i1}your{\i0\fscx30} {\r} umbrella.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.97,0:09:43.97,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,That explains why you were drenched.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.97,0:09:45.77,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,It's a little embarrassing...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.77,0:09:48.69,Kimi-Signs,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnFansub Block\fs60\frz333\fscy800\c&HD8E8F7&\pos(1047,404)\clip(m 958 506 b 960 530 945 560 925 566 l 898 633 b 897 667 878 684 864 697 866 724 848 750 831 759 l 805 810 850 848 1034 501 1050 408 1004 420)}A
