Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.77,0:09:48.69,Kimi-Signs,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur1\fnBrianne's hand\fs60\frz333\c&H212633&\pos(973,566)}u
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.77,0:09:48.69,Kimi-Signs,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur1\fnBrianne's hand\fs60\frz333\c&H212633&\pos(958,595)}m
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.77,0:09:48.69,Kimi-Signs,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur1\fnBrianne's hand\fs60\frz333\c&H212633&\pos(945,617)}a
