Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.77,0:09:48.69,Kimi-Signs,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur1\fnBrianne's hand\fs60\frz333\c&H212633&\pos(905,688)}a
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.77,0:09:48.69,Kimi-Signs,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur1\fnBrianne's hand\fs60\frz333\c&H212633&\pos(890,715)}w
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.77,0:09:48.69,Kimi-Signs,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur1\fnBrianne's hand\fs60\frz333\c&H212633&\pos(879,739)}a
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.77,0:09:48.69,Kimi-Signs,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur1\fnBrianne's hand\fs60\frz333\c&H212633&\pos(862,770)}k
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.77,0:09:48.69,Kimi-Signs,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur1\fnBrianne's hand\fs60\frz333\c&H212633&\pos(848,794)}o
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.23,0:09:48.69,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,You're right; it's got your name on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.48,0:09:52.48,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I've had it since elementary school...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.86,0:09:57.20,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Mind if I take him?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.82,0:09:59.66,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,You would?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.28,0:10:02.03,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.58,0:10:05.04,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,It's okay; I'm used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.45,0:10:06.58,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Used to it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.58,0:10:10.71,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Animals have always been afraid of me. Same with little children.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.96,0:10:15.55,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,It's just that... dogs are my favorite animals...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.88,0:10:22.26,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Oh yeah, don't people say that dogs start to\N like people if they're friendly with their owners?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.47,0:10:25.72,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,See? We're good friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.18,0:10:26.98,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Good...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.48,0:10:28.94,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Good friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.81,0:10:31.15,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.65,0:10:32.82,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Everything's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.32,0:10:34.32,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.69,0:10:42.45,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,It's strange; because when Kazehaya-kun says so, I really do start thinking that everything's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.45,0:10:46.45,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,He's always like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.62,0:10:50.46,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,He doesn't have a wall that separates him from anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.17,0:10:53.09,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,That's why everyone likes him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.25,0:10:56.38,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,People and dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.96,0:11:03.89,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,There's a great wall between me and\N everyone that I want to break down little by little.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.10,0:11:06.35,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.31,0:11:11.44,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I want to become friends with everyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.40,0:11:16.48,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I'll do my best...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.24,0:11:18.86,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.32,0:11:20.24,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Go for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.66,0:11:23.03,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,You'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.41,0:11:31.33,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.75,0:11:35.29,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,U-Umm, if it's not too much trouble...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.92,0:11:40.01,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Will you let me see him again?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.05,0:11:43.47,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,What, just the dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.93,0:11:44.68,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,What about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.68,0:11:46.76,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,You, too, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.76,0:11:47.93,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Naturally!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.35,0:11:52.44,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Then I guess we have a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.31,0:11:55.77,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Kazehaya-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.57,0:11:57.69,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,It's really strange...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.40,0:12:01.61,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,For some reason, I don't feel...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.24,0:12:06.37,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,...that there's a wall between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.20,0:12:11.75,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,This has... never happened with anyone else before...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.25,0:12:16.84,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,This is for yesterday...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.46,0:12:20.17,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I guess I'll wait until after school to give it to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.17,0:12:22.63,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,And in a place where there aren't many people around...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.59,0:12:26.89,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,But I wonder if they'll eat them...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.30,0:12:29.26,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I made them myself, after all...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.26,0:12:31.52,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe I went a little too far on this one...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.06,0:12:38.73,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I'm starting to sweat...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.73,0:12:43.28,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I-I'm pretty used to people refusing things like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.03,0:12:44.70,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.53,0:12:47.99,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.99,0:12:51.95,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, you have math during first period?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.37,0:12:53.66,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like we're in different classes, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.66,0:12:55.25,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.25,0:12:59.09,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, the dog is doing well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.00,0:13:03.30,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,I haven't come up with a good name for him yet, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.09,0:13:05.51,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,You'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.05,0:13:08.26,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Kazehaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.26,0:13:09.14,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.01,0:13:10.76,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,See you around.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.77,0:13:23.07,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I... hope he'll like the cookies...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.78,0:13:27.61,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, that seat is open.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.07,0:13:30.16,Default,Girl2,0000,0000,0000,,What, the one in the front?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.49,0:13:31.33,Default,Girl2,0000,0000,0000,,You're really going to sit there?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.33,0:13:34.50,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong with that? There's no one sitting next to me, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.87,0:13:37.29,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Who usually sits here again?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.29,0:13:38.75,Default,Girl2,0000,0000,0000,,Sadako.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.17,0:13:41.09,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Oh... Sadako?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.13,0:13:47.80,Default,Girl2,0000,0000,0000,,Yuka sat in Sadako's seat once and went down with a cold for a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.64,0:13:50.80,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Go for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.93,0:13:56.14,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.94,0:13:59.52,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,The seat's fine...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.52,0:14:04.99,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,It's not dirty or anything, and...\N nothing will happen to you if you sit there...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.44,0:14:09.28,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I... don't have an ability to make someone sick or anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.28,0:14:14.37,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,And... I can't see ghosts, either...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.50,0:14:16.79,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I said it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.25,0:14:19.33,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I just said it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.05,0:14:28.43,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,There's always...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.47,0:14:32.76,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,There's always a next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.31,0:14:42.90,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Things can't change so suddenly, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.94,0:14:49.57,Default,Teach,0000,0000,0000,,Well, we'll be changing seating assignments during\N our homeroom session, so you can do it on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.95,0:14:55.29,Default,Teach,0000,0000,0000,,Try not to make too much noise...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.50,0:14:58.66,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,All right, let's do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.66,0:15:01.46,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,The teacher didn't look too well...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.63,0:15:05.71,Default,Girl2,0000,0000,0000,,I think it was during summer vacation when he started feeling ill.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.71,0:15:07.51,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, during summer vaca-
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.92,0:15:13.10,Default,All,0000,0000,0000,,Is it because he forced Sadako to run errands during the summer?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.47,0:15:17.06,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Ueda sat next to Sadako and his grades ended up dropping, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.06,0:15:19.43,Default,Guy2,0000,0000,0000,,Nakanishi broke his leg, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.43,0:15:23.40,Default,Guy2,0000,0000,0000,,He insulted her after that test of courage!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.86,0:15:27.61,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,A-Anyway, let's just get this over with!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.61,0:15:28.69,Default,Guy2,0000,0000,0000,,G-Good idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.69,0:15:31.20,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Seating change, huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.20,0:15:35.37,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I hope I'll be able to be friends\N with the person next to me this time...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.04,0:15:40.87,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if it's just my imagination.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.87,0:15:44.21,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I get the feeling everyone is staring at me...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.79,0:15:49.01,Default,All,0000,0000,0000,,Please, God. Don't make me sit anywhere near Sadako.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.72,0:15:52.13,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,What number did you get, Kazehaya?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.13,0:15:53.09,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,32.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.55,0:15:55.60,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, you're right next to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.60,0:15:57.97,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Seriously?! Trade with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.52,0:15:59.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\alpha&HFF&}PLACEHOLDER
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.52,0:16:01.14,Default-alt,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Please! This is the only thing I'll ever ask of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.10,0:16:03.40,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, so Kazehaya-kun is somewhere over there...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.40,0:16:10.44,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I'm a little sad I don't get to share disappointment\N or happiness with people during times like these...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.64,0:16:03.40,Default-alt,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Heck no!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.94,0:16:14.03,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Aww, I'm in the front row!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.03,0:16:15.32,Default,Girl2,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, that sucks!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.54,0:16:22.87,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.87,0:16:26.79,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I'm in the back, so if you like, we could trade...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.79,0:16:29.05,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,No, it's fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.05,0:16:30.01,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.63,0:16:33.34,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Sadako's number 3!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.34,0:16:34.80,Default,Guy2,0000,0000,0000,,What are the numbers around her?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.80,0:16:37.30,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,12, 19, and 25!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.30,0:16:39.01,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Awesome! Not mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.01,0:16:42.31,Default,Guy2,0000,0000,0000,,You really have to watch out for 19! It's right next to her!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.68,0:16:45.35,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Th-That hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.35,0:16:47.52,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I can hear everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.82,0:16:52.61,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,But... there's no helping it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.53,0:16:59.62,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I hope that someday, I'll be able to say\N to someone, "I'm happy to be in this seat."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.16,0:17:04.08,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Whoever that picked 19, will you trade with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.54,0:17:09.13,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Kazehaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.31,0:17:23.18,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Awesome! I get to sit next to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.15,0:17:32.48,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,You can have this back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.16,0:17:44.04,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Yoshida, you're up next...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.04,0:17:44.70,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.70,0:17:45.91,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,No need.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.75,0:17:51.29,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.63,0:17:53.17,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Move, Ryu!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.17,0:17:54.09,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.09,0:17:56.05,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,This doesn't concern you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.05,0:17:57.84,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,I want to sit here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.26,0:18:01.22,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,Back corner of the room, by the windows.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.07,0:18:12.94,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.86,0:18:15.28,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,W-Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.28,0:18:18.61,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,As thanks for yesterday, I brought some cookies...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.83,0:18:23.20,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,You brought some for me, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.20,0:18:24.08,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.08,0:18:26.62,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,And I borrowed these from you...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.46,0:18:29.87,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,These are really good...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.92,0:18:32.79,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.25,0:18:36.26,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Did you make them yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.72,0:18:38.63,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.63,0:18:41.47,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,I'll gladly accept them...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.30,0:18:44.43,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,You're right! These are good!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.89,0:18:47.18,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,I'm hungry...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.18,0:18:50.48,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Didn't you just eat lunch?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.77,0:18:52.48,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,I'm hun-
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.66,0:19:10.54,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.88,0:19:13.59,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so happy...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.05,0:19:19.26,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,...to be in this seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.93,0:19:23.55,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,From the bottom of my heart...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.97,0:19:27.02,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I'm happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.54,0:19:49.50,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Kuronuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.71,0:19:56.00,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Good, you're not crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.25,0:19:59.55,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I-I'm sorry for doing something so unsightly...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.63,0:20:03.84,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Unsightly?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.31,0:20:08.52,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, now I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.93,0:20:12.14,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,The reason I don't feel a wall between Kazehaya-kun and me...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.77,0:20:22.82,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,...is because he breaks it down easily with a single smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.28,0:20:28.45,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Is that Kazehaya and Sadako?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.45,0:20:28.79,Default,Girl2,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.79,0:20:31.12,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Haven't we been seeing them together a lot recently?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.75,0:20:35.00,Default,Girl2,0000,0000,0000,,Did Sadako really get rejected?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.46,0:20:40.63,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,See you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.05,0:20:46.22,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,The admiration. The respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.05,0:20:49.01,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Those feelings haven't changed at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.52,0:20:52.23,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.64,0:20:56.40,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder when this feeling first arose in me...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.69,0:21:02.61,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,A feeling that overwhelms the admiration and the respect....
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.49,0:21:05.57,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Something so much greater...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.91,0:21:09.62,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Love.
