Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.04,0:21:26.01,Kimi_no_Todoke_ED1-TL,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1.5}I want to become one of those paper airplanes filling the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.85,0:21:36.48,Kimi_no_Todoke_ED1-TL,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1.5}"I don't understand." That is your answer?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.48,0:21:40.15,Kimi_no_Todoke_ED1-TL,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1.5}Let's blow a bubble
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.15,0:21:48.36,Kimi_no_Todoke_ED1-TL,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1.5}Though it'll likely burst before reaching the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.36,0:21:53.75,Kimi_no_Todoke_ED1-TL,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1.5}I just want to know. This moment won't last forever,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.75,0:22:01.63,Kimi_no_Todoke_ED1-TL,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1.5}Though I want to keep watching you till the end of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.63,0:22:12.81,Kimi_no_Todoke_ED1-TL,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1.5}I want to become one of those paper airplanes filling the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.97,0:22:21.02,Kimi_no_Todoke_ED1-TL,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1.5}So you can find the right one.
