Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.11,0:22:27.40,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,A new seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.78,0:22:30.99,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,My dream is slowly turning into reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.95,0:22:34.16,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Next time: After School.
